+
+## Next Steps
+
+1. Run `/story-specify` on S001 to replace its placeholder with a full experience-first specification.
+2. Specify S002 after S001's contract is settled, then S003 after the review/edit contract is settled.
+3. Run `/epic-analyze` to adversarially validate this breakdown before implementation.
